      "message": "this is what I thought. How are we going to have a definition for `_exit` that works for both ec and zephyr? In zephyr, is there no location where this definition can be made in isolation from the ec code? We can definitely use `abort()` to align both but I am not sure if this is the route Tom would like to pursue for the ec version.",
