      "writtenOn": "2024-12-20T18:50:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e  How are we going to have a definition for _exit that works for both ec and zephyr?\n\nDo we really need one definition of `_exit()`? Personally, I would leave EC\u0027s definition in `syscalls.c` and implement Zephyr\u0027s version in `exit.c`.",
      "parentUuid": "f2224224_bc3cd7a8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 27,
